  "bio": "Van Bree Tattoo in Abbotsford, Canada, was an avant-garde studio renowned for its mastery in dotwork, illustrative, fine line, and anime-style tattoos. With a passion for ink, their artists transformed skin into remarkable works of art. However, the studio has permanently closed its doors, and they extend their heartfelt gratitude to all their patrons and encourage any inquiries or concerns to be directed to vanbreetattoo@gmail.com.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Abbotsford, British Columbia, Canada"
